{"id":340016,"date":"2023-03-15T13:20:10","date_gmt":"2023-03-15T12:20:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/?p=340016"},"modified":"2023-04-05T16:28:21","modified_gmt":"2023-04-05T14:28:21","slug":"la-famdt-vous-donne-rendez-vous-a-marseille-la-semaine-prochaine","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/actualite-famdt\/la-famdt-vous-donne-rendez-vous-a-marseille-la-semaine-prochaine\/","title":{"rendered":"La LMELB vous donne rendez-vous \u00e0 Marseille la semaine prochaine !"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rencontres professionnelles Babel Minots&nbsp;les 21, 22 et 23 mars 2023 \u00e0 Marseille<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"190\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.17.40-1024x190.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-340029\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.17.40-1024x190.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.17.40-300x56.png 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.17.40-768x143.png 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.17.40-1536x285.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.17.40-2048x380.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Avec de nombreux partenaires, la LMELB s&rsquo;associe \u00e0 l&rsquo;organisation des rencontres professionnelles du festival&nbsp;<strong>Babel Minots<\/strong>, pour questionner ensemble les enjeux du secteur et participer \u00e0 la structuration de la fili\u00e8re musicale jeune public.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/www.babelminots.com\/rencontrespros\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Programme complet des rencontres ici<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/form.heeds.eu\/registration\/15191\/7aecf0400b01b711f56eefe9c0ab0de8?fbclid=IwAR30COPr0e9OP43ZBHXQPOuFhAKzt2tdo8adSnQHSlrLbcCWUbtpmmD3u0Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Inscrivez-vous aux rencontres ici<\/a>. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>BABEL MUSIC XP<\/strong> <strong>les 23, 24 et 25 mars 2023 \u00e0 Marseille<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"298\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.18.40-1024x298.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-340030\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.18.40-1024x298.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.18.40-300x87.png 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.18.40-768x224.png 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.18.40-1536x447.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Capture-decran-2023-03-15-a-13.18.40-2048x596.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La LMELB s&rsquo;associe pleinement \u00e0 la relance de ce salon\u00a0essentiel et vous donne d&rsquo;ors et d\u00e9j\u00e0 rendez-vous sur son\u00a0<strong>stand n\u00b056<\/strong>\u00a0et sur plusieurs temps forts d&rsquo;\u00e9changes et de d\u00e9bats au service de l&rsquo;int\u00e9r\u00eat g\u00e9n\u00e9ral et de la consolidation de la fili\u00e8re \u00e0\u00a0l&rsquo;image de la\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/famdt.us16.list-manage.com\/track\/click?u=d5c9cf78262e265d64c1b6cb8&amp;id=b94a4f649e&amp;e=838d0332b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">table ronde<\/a> construite en partenariat avec la Cit\u00e9 de la Musique avec le Showcase de SPARTENZA\u00a0(s\u00e9lection officielle BABEL MUSIC XP 2023).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/babelmusicxp.com\/le-salon-professionnel\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Plus d&rsquo;infos sur le salon et les rencontres pros ici<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Vous trouverez dans la riche\u00a0<strong>programmation du salon Babel Music XP\u00a0<\/strong>plusieurs \u00e9quipes adh\u00e9rent.e.s de la LMELB &#8211; Bravo \u00e0 eux et \u00e0 ne pas manquer :<br><br><strong>Jeudi :\u00a0<\/strong><br><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/famdt.us16.list-manage.com\/track\/click?u=d5c9cf78262e265d64c1b6cb8&amp;id=9c0939de19&amp;e=838d0332b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AN\u2019PAGAY<\/a>\u00a0&#8211; La R\u00e9union<\/strong>\u00a0&#8211;\u00a0<em>Les irr\u00e9sistibles transes hybrides de l\u2019\u00e9lectric maloya\u00a0<\/em>par le collectif\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/famdt.us16.list-manage.com\/track\/click?u=d5c9cf78262e265d64c1b6cb8&amp;id=96c47f6ac9&amp;e=838d0332b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">La curieuse<\/a>.<br><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/famdt.us16.list-manage.com\/track\/click?u=d5c9cf78262e265d64c1b6cb8&amp;id=525c72efc9&amp;e=838d0332b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPARTENZA<\/a>\u00a0&#8211; Italie\/Alg\u00e9rie<\/strong>\u00a0&#8211; Passerelles et cordes sensibles des rives siciliennes et alg\u00e9riennes par\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/famdt.us16.list-manage.com\/track\/click?u=d5c9cf78262e265d64c1b6cb8&amp;id=47d68ab3f5&amp;e=838d0332b4\">Arts et Musiques en Provence<\/a>.<br><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/famdt.us16.list-manage.com\/track\/click?u=d5c9cf78262e265d64c1b6cb8&amp;id=b85570f1cf&amp;e=838d0332b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">S.T.O.R.M<\/a>. &#8211; Occitanie<\/strong>\u00a0&#8211; Les fabuleuses hybridations d\u2019un power-duo insolite par\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/famdt.us16.list-manage.com\/track\/click?u=d5c9cf78262e265d64c1b6cb8&amp;id=0ad02661ec&amp;e=838d0332b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kiwi Production<\/a>.<br><br><strong>Vendredi :<\/strong><br><a href=\"https:\/\/babelmusicxp.com\/les-concerts\/la-programmation\/de-la-crau\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DE LA CRAU<\/a>\u00a0<strong>&#8211; Occitanie<\/strong>\u00a0&#8211;\u00a0L\u2019inventeur g\u00e9nial du folk-rock psychotropique proven\u00e7al par la\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.occitanie-musique.com\/fr\/index\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Compagnie Lamparo<\/a>.<br><br><strong>Samedi :<br><a href=\"https:\/\/famdt.us16.list-manage.com\/track\/click?u=d5c9cf78262e265d64c1b6cb8&amp;id=ec08a6655d&amp;e=838d0332b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BARRUT<\/a>\u00a0&#8211; Occitanie<\/strong>\u00a0&#8211; Le ch\u0153ur battant des polyphonies et percussions occitanes par\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/oxivent-production.com\/barrut\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ox&rsquo;ivent<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/babelmusicxp.com\/les-concerts\/la-programmation\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">D\u00e9couvrez toute la programmation ici<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>La LMELB vous donne rendez-vous \u00e0 Marseille du 21 au 25 mars, pour